# Supabase reset

When the user asks to clear / wipe / reset the **server database**, test with **fresh data**, or re-apply cloud schema after SQL changes:

1. Read `docs/supabase-reset.md` (workspace path `app/docs/supabase-reset.md`).
2. Implement that procedure. Do not invent a new wipe, drop the mail-service, or skip the local Room warning.
3. Never print `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN`, or seed passwords in chat.
